<section id="about" style="background:var(--green-tint);scroll-margin-top:84px;border-block:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--green) 15%,transparent)">
  <div style="max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;padding:calc(3.5*var(--leading)) var(--edge)">
    <span style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:0 0 14px">Foundational story</span>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(310px,1fr));gap:calc(2*var(--leading)) clamp(36px,6vw,96px);align-items:start">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,42px);line-height:1.2;margin:0;max-width:18ch">Built from a personal commitment to our elders.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:var(--leading);margin:20px 0 0;max-width:52ch;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 82%,transparent)">Silsila was born from a simple realization: too many older adults in our community navigate their golden years isolated by language barriers and the quiet difficulty of asking for help. Having lost my own grandparents, I created this service to provide the exact bridge of care I wished they had.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:var(--leading);margin:18px 0 0;max-width:52ch;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 82%,transparent)">Based in Southern California since 2016, our roots run deep within local community institutions like IOK, ICSGV, and the MCC network. Coming from a family dedicated to care and education, supporting seniors is a natural extension of our home.</p>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;margin:24px 0 0">Juveriyah Salat<span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:14px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 65%,transparent);margin-top:4px">Founder, Silsila Apna Senior Concierge</span></p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--leading)">
        <div style="border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--green) 35%,transparent);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:calc(1.5*var(--leading));background:#ffffff">
          <span style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:0 0 16px">Credentials &amp; compliance</span>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
            <span style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px">Registered California business entity</span>
            <span style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px">Comprehensive commercial liability insurance</span>
            <span style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px">Clean California driving record</span>
            <span style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px">Fully insured transit vehicles</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:0 0 14px">Absolute transparency</span>
          <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">We encourage families to request community references and meet us in person before booking. With no long-term contracts or notice periods, you retain complete flexibility from day one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div style="height:48px;background-image:var(--tile);background-repeat:repeat-x;opacity:0.4"></div>

<div style="max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--edge)">

  <section id="area" style="padding:calc(3*var(--leading)) 0;scroll-margin-top:84px">
    <span style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:0 0 14px">Service coverage</span>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:calc(1.5*var(--leading)) calc(2.5*var(--leading))">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:400;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:0">San Gabriel Valley</h2>
        <p style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:8px 0 0">Primary weekly service area</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:14px 0 0;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 75%,transparent)">Monrovia, Arcadia, Duarte, Pasadena, Temple City, Rosemead, San Gabriel, Alhambra, Covina, West Covina, Azusa, and Glendora.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-inline-start:1px solid var(--color-divider);padding-inline-start:calc(2.5*var(--leading))">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:400;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:0">Orange County</h2>
        <p style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:8px 0 0">By custom arrangement</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:14px 0 0;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 75%,transparent)">Available as extended visits reaching outward toward Irvine when scheduled in advance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-inline-start:1px solid var(--color-divider);padding-inline-start:calc(2.5*var(--leading))">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:400;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:0">San Diego</h2>
        <p style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:8px 0 0">Select availability</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:14px 0 0;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 75%,transparent)">Handled case-by-case with clear prior scoping before any regular commitments are made.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="hr">

  <section style="padding:calc(3*var(--leading)) 0;scroll-margin-top:84px" id="questions">
    <span style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:0 0 var(--leading)">Frequently asked questions</span>
    <div style="max-width:80ch">
      <details style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:20px;line-height:1.35">How are pricing and rates structured?<span class="chev" style="flex:none;width:10px;height:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--green);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s"></span></summary>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0 0 20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">Rates depend on your chosen plan, total hours, and driving distances, so we outline them clearly on our introductory call. Your first week is offered at half price with no deposits or binding contracts. Because this is specialized private-pay assistance, insurance is not billed directly, though itemized receipts are provided for potential long-term care policy reimbursement.</p>
      </details>
      <details style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:20px;line-height:1.35">What if my parent hesitates and says they don't need help?<span class="chev" style="flex:none;width:10px;height:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--green);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s"></span></summary>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0 0 20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">This is very common. We frame our visits around companionship and sharing chai rather than clinical care. Once trust is established naturally, appointments and errands follow with ease. Most families begin gently with the Chai plan.</p>
      </details>
      <details style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:20px;line-height:1.35">Can I coordinate this if I live out of state?<span class="chev" style="flex:none;width:10px;height:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--green);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s"></span></summary>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0 0 20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">Absolutely. Many of our clients are managed by children living elsewhere. You receive structured weekly written updates after visits, ensuring complete peace of mind.</p>
      </details>
      <details style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:20px;line-height:1.35">What language options are supported?<span class="chev" style="flex:none;width:10px;height:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--green);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s"></span></summary>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0 0 20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">We currently support Urdu, Hindi, Memoni, and English fluently. Let us know your parent's primary language during our call, and we will confirm matching availability instantly.</p>
      </details>
      <details style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:20px;line-height:1.35">What are your typical hours of operation?<span class="chev" style="flex:none;width:10px;height:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--green);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s"></span></summary>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0 0 20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">Visits are available on weekdays from 4:00 PM onward and flexibly throughout weekends. Morning weekday slots will expand as our team of companions grows.</p>
      </details>
      <details style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:20px;line-height:1.35">Do clients need to be Muslim to use Silsila?<span class="chev" style="flex:none;width:10px;height:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--green);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s"></span></summary>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0 0 20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">Not at all. While our roots and cultural fluency stem from the Muslim community, our services are open to seniors of any background within our service area.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="hr">

  <section id="book" style="padding:calc(3*var(--leading)) 0 calc(2.5*var(--leading));scroll-margin-top:84px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(310px,1fr));gap:calc(2*var(--leading)) clamp(36px,6vw,88px);align-items:start">
    <div>
      <span style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin:0 0 14px">Book a free call</span>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,42px);line-height:1.2;margin:0;max-width:18ch">Let's discuss the support your family needs.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:var(--leading);margin:18px 0 0;max-width:44ch;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">A quick 3-step form taking under two minutes. We will call you back within one business day in your chosen language. No commitments or payments are required.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:var(--leading);margin:var(--leading) 0 0"><a href="mailto:hello@apnaconcierge.com">hello@apnaconcierge.com</a><br><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 68%,transparent);">Juveriyah Salat, Founder</span></p>
      <p style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:23px;margin:var(--leading) 0 0;max-width:40ch;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 65%,transparent);border-left:2px solid var(--green);padding-left:14px">Please refrain from entering sensitive medical details in this form; save them for our call.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--green) 30%,transparent);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:calc(1.5*var(--leading));background:#ffffff">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:var(--leading)">
        <span style="height:2px;flex:1;background:{{ bar1 }}"></span>
        <span style="height:2px;flex:1;background:{{ bar2 }}"></span>
        <span style="height:2px;flex:1;background:{{ bar3 }}"></span>
        <span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);white-space:nowrap;font-feature-settings:'tnum' 1">{{ stepLabel }}</span>
      </div>

      <sc-if value="{{ isStep1 }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-4)">
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0">Who is this support for?</p>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="s-rel">This care is for</label>
            <select class="input" id="s-rel" value="{{ rel }}" onChange="{{ onRel }}">
              <option>My mother</option>
              <option>My father</option>
              <option>Both parents</option>
              <option>Another relative</option>
              <option>Myself</option>
              <option>A client or congregant of mine</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:var(--space-4)">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="s-age">Their age</label>
              <input class="input" id="s-age" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="{{ age }}" onInput="{{ onAge }}" placeholder="78">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="s-city">City location</label>
              <select class="input" id="s-city" value="{{ city }}" onChange="{{ onCity }}">
                <option>Monrovia</option>
                <option>Arcadia</option>
                <option>Pasadena</option>
                <option>Duarte</option>
                <option>Temple City</option>
                <option>Rosemead or San Gabriel</option>
                <option>Alhambra</option>
                <option>Covina or West Covina</option>
                <option>Elsewhere in the SGV</option>
                <option>Orange County</option>
                <option>San Diego</option>
                <option>Somewhere else</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="s-mob">Mobility &amp; movement</label>
            <select class="input" id="s-mob" value="{{ mobility }}" onChange="{{ onMobility }}">
              <option>Walks on their own</option>
              <option>Walks slowly, prefers an arm</option>
              <option>Uses a cane</option>
              <option>Uses a walker</option>
              <option>Uses a wheelchair, transfers themselves</option>
              <option>Uses a wheelchair, needs help transferring</option>
            </select>
            <span style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 65%,transparent)">We can steady a door or arm, but cannot perform physical lifts or transfers.</span>
          </div>
          <sc-if value="{{ liftWarning }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:22px;color:var(--color-accent-700);border:1px solid var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:12px 14px">Submit this request regardless. We will advise you candidly on our call regarding what we can accommodate.</p>
          </sc-if>
          <div class="field">
            <span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em">Companion gender preference</span>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-4);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px">
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="gender" checked="{{ gW }}" onChange="{{ pickW }}"><span class="dot"></span>A woman</label>
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="gender" checked="{{ gM }}" onChange="{{ pickM }}"><span class="dot"></span>A man</label>
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="gender" checked="{{ gA }}" onChange="{{ pickA }}"><span class="dot"></span>No preference</label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onClick="{{ next }}">Next step</button></div>
        </div>
      </sc-if>

      <sc-if value="{{ isStep2 }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-4)">
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0">What does the weekly routine require?</p>
          <div class="field">
            <span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em">Key days of importance</span>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px">
              <sc-for list="{{ days }}" as="d" hint-placeholder-count="7">
                <button type="button" class="tag tag-outline" style="cursor:pointer;background:{{ d.bg }};color:{{ d.fg }};border-color:{{ d.border }}" onClick="{{ d.toggle }}">{{ d.label }}</button>
              </sc-for>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="s-hours">Estimated weekly hours</label>
            <select class="input" id="s-hours" value="{{ hours }}" onChange="{{ onHours }}">
              <option>About 3 a week — Chai</option>
              <option>About 6 a week — Dawat</option>
              <option>About 10 a week — Ghar</option>
              <option>Unsure, help me determine</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="s-need">What tasks remain unhandled right now?</label>
            <textarea class="input" id="s-need" rows="4" style="resize:vertical;font-family:var(--font-body);line-height:24px" value="{{ need }}" onInput="{{ onNeed }}" placeholder="e.g., No one available to drive on Fridays for Jummah, prescription pickups piling up."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="s-before">Prior experience with similar services</label>
            <select class="input" id="s-before" value="{{ before }}" onChange="{{ onBefore }}">
              <option>No, this is our first time</option>
              <option>Yes, utilized a traditional agency</option>
              <option>Yes, hired community members previously</option>
              <option>Tried before and it didn't fit</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-3);flex-wrap:wrap">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" onClick="{{ back }}">Back</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onClick="{{ next }}">Next step</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </sc-if>

      <sc-if value="{{ isStep3 }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
        <form style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-4)" onSubmit="{{ submit }}">
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0">How should we contact you?</p>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:var(--space-4)">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="s-name">Your name</label>
              <input class="input" id="s-name" type="text" value="{{ name }}" onInput="{{ onName }}" placeholder="Ayesha">
              <sc-if value="{{ errName }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}"><span style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:20px;color:var(--color-accent-700)">Please provide your name.</span></sc-if>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="s-phone">Phone number</label>
              <input class="input" id="s-phone" type="tel" value="{{ phone }}" onInput="{{ onPhone }}" placeholder="(626) 555 0142">
              <sc-if value="{{ errPhone }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}"><span style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:20px;color:var(--color-accent-700)">Please provide a valid callback number.</span></sc-if>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="s-email">Email address (optional)</label>
            <input class="input" id="s-email" type="email" value="{{ email }}" onInput="{{ onEmail }}" placeholder="you@example.com">
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:var(--space-4)">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="s-when">Preferred call time</label>
              <select class="input" id="s-when" value="{{ when }}" onChange="{{ onWhen }}">
                <option>Mornings</option>
                <option>Afternoons</option>
                <option>Evenings after 6</option>
                <option>Weekends</option>
                <option>Any time</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="s-heard">How did you hear about us?</label>
              <select class="input" id="s-heard" value="{{ heard }}" onChange="{{ onHeard }}">
                <option>From the masjid</option>
                <option>From a friend or relative</option>
                <option>Community WhatsApp group</option>
                <option>Instagram or Facebook</option>
                <option>Search engine</option>
                <option>Other source</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em">Preferred conversation language</span>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-4);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px">
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="lang" checked="{{ lU }}" onChange="{{ pickU }}"><span class="dot"></span>Urdu</label>
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="lang" checked="{{ lE }}" onChange="{{ pickE }}"><span class="dot"></span>English</label>
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="lang" checked="{{ lM }}" onChange="{{ pickMem }}"><span class="dot"></span>Memoni</label>
              <label class="radio" style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="lang" checked="{{ lAny }}" onChange="{{ pickAny }}"><span class="dot"></span>Either</label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-3);flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" onClick="{{ back }}">Back</button>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit request</button>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:20px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 65%,transparent)">Your information remains strictly confidential within Silsila Apna.</span>
        </form>
      </sc-if>

      <sc-if value="{{ isDone }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <span style="font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)">Submitted successfully</span>
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;margin:0">{{ thanks }}</p>
          <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:26px;margin:0;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 78%,transparent)">We will call {{ shownPhone }} within one business day, {{ shownWhen }}. If urgent, reach us directly at (510) 437-0136.</p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 70%,transparent)">Your first week features our half-price introduction, with no payments due prior to your first visit.</p>
          <div><button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" onClick="{{ restart }}">Submit another inquiry</button></div>
        </div>
      </sc-if>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<div style="height:48px;background-image:var(--tile);background-repeat:repeat-x;opacity:0.4"></div>

<footer style="background:var(--green-tint);border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--green) 15%,transparent)">
  <div style="max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;padding:calc(2.5*var(--leading)) var(--edge);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--leading) calc(2.5*var(--leading));justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;line-height:23px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 72%,transparent)">
    <div style="max-width:66ch">
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--color-text);font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:18px">Silsila Apna Senior Concierge · San Gabriel Valley, California</p>
      <p style="margin:0">Providing non-medical companion, errand, and transportation assistance services. Silsila Apna is not a licensed home care organization, home health agency, hospice, or commercial carrier, and offers no medical, nursing, legal, or financial advice. We do not perform physical client lifts, administer medications, or handle tasks requiring professional licensure. Transportation is included solely as part of hourly companion visits. Services are available to all individuals in our coverage area regardless of faith, origin, or protected characteristics.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px">
      <a href="mailto:hello@apnaconcierge.com" style="text-decoration:none">hello@apnaconcierge.com</a>
